  <Id>k__BackingField: 5
  <Title>k__BackingField: "Thanh ni\xEAn kinh l\u1ECBch"
  <Description>k__BackingField: "Th\u1EDDi gian tr\xF4i mau tr\xF4i qua, ng\u01B0\u01A1i
    c\u0169ng kh\xF4ng c\xF2n l\xE0 n\u0103m \u0111\xF3 ng\xE2y th\u01A1 \u0111\u1EE9a
    b\xE9, Thanh ni\xEAn th\u1EDDi k\xEC c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u01A1i...?"
  <Groups>k__BackingField:
  - <Id>k__BackingField: 23
    <StatOptions>k__BackingField:
    - <Id>k__BackingField: 44
      <Name>k__BackingField: "Th\u1EA3m tao t\u1EEB h\xF4n"
      <Modifiers>k__BackingField:
      - <Type>k__BackingField: 13
        <Action>k__BackingField: 1
        <Value>k__BackingField: -30
        <Cost>k__BackingField: -1
      <Effective>k__BackingField: "T\xE2m c\u1EA3nh -30"
      <Description>k__BackingField: "M\u01B0\u1EDDi l\u0103m tu\u1ED5i n\u0103m \u0111\xF3,
        ng\u01B0\u01A1i h\xF4n \u01B0\u1EDBc \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng gh\xE9t
        b\u1ECF ng\u01B0\u01A1i t\u01B0\u1EDBng m\u1EA1o kh\xF4ng t\u1ED1t sai ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
        b\u1ED9i \u01B0\u1EDBc, ng\u01B0\u01A1i chuy\u1EC7n nh\u01B0 v\u1EADy b\u1ECB
        \u0111\xE1m ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u1EBF gi\u1EC5u, th\u1EADt to \u1EA3nh h\u01B0\u1EDFng
        t\u1EDBi t\xE2m t\xEDnh c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u01A1i."
    <Exclusives>k__BackingField: 21000000
  - <Id>k__BackingField: 24
    <StatOptions>k__BackingField:
    - <Id>k__BackingField: 45
      <Name>k__BackingField: "Cao th\u1EE7 khinh c\xF4ng"
      <Modifiers>k__BackingField:
      - <Type>k__BackingField: 9
        <Action>k__BackingField: 1
        <Value>k__BackingField: 3
        <Cost>k__BackingField: 1
      <Effective>k__BackingField: "Ban \u0111\u1EA7u \u0111\u1ED9n t\u1ED1c +3"
      <Description>k__BackingField: "B\u1EDFi v\xEC tu luy\u1EC7n qua m\u1ED9t ch\xFAt
        b\u1EA5t nh\u1EADp l\u01B0u ph\xE0m nh\xE2n khinh c\xF4ng v\xF5 h\u1ECDc
        c\xF9ng b\u1ED9 ph\xE1p, t\u1ED1c \u0111\u1ED9 c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u01A1i th\u1EAFng
        ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\u1ED3ng l\u1EE9a, kh\xF4ng c\xF3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi c\xF3
        th\u1EC3 \u0111u\u1ED5i k\u1ECBp ng\u01B0\u01A1i."
    <Exclusives>k__BackingField: 21000000
  - <Id>k__BackingField: 25
    <StatOptions>k__BackingField:
    - <Id>k__BackingField: 46
      <Name>k__BackingField: "D\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng h\u1ECDc \u0111\u1ED3"
